Dialogue: Marked=0,1:37:56.53,1:37:57.87,692731105725af4e00d33ede,Alek.sys,0,0,0,,Да-да-да.
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:37:57.85,1:38:01.72,692731105725af4e00d33edf,Alek.sys,0,0,0,,Там есть From Roman... Первый From Roman 2, From Roman 3.
